@startuml
!theme plain
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center

title Form-Based Authentication Sequence - Centre de Formation

actor "User" as WebUser
participant "Browser" as Browser
participant "Login Page\n/login" as LoginPage
participant "Spring Security\nFilter Chain" as WebSecurityFilter
participant "CustomUserDetailsService" as UserDetailsService
participant "UserRepository" as UserRepo
database "Database" as DB
participant "PasswordEncoder" as PasswordEncoder
participant "SecurityContext" as SecurityContext
participant "Session Manager" as SessionManager
participant "Dashboard\n/admin/dashboard" as Dashboard

WebUser -> Browser: Navigate to protected resource
Browser -> WebSecurityFilter: GET /admin/dashboard
WebSecurityFilter -> WebSecurityFilter: Check authentication
WebSecurityFilter -> Browser: Redirect to /login
Browser -> LoginPage: Display login form

WebUser -> Browser: Enter credentials\n(email, password)
Browser -> WebSecurityFilter: POST /login\n(email, password)

WebSecurityFilter -> UserDetailsService: loadUserByUsername(email)
UserDetailsService -> UserRepo: findByEmail(email)
UserRepo -> DB: SELECT * FROM users\nWHERE email = ?
DB --> UserRepo: User entity
UserRepo --> UserDetailsService: Optional<User>

UserDetailsService -> UserDetailsService: getAuthorities(user)\n[ROLE_ADMIN/FORMATEUR/ETUDIANT]
UserDetailsService --> WebSecurityFilter: UserDetails\n(email, password, authorities)

WebSecurityFilter -> PasswordEncoder: matches(rawPassword, encodedPassword)
PasswordEncoder --> WebSecurityFilter: true/false

alt Authentication Success
    WebSecurityFilter -> SecurityContext: setAuthentication(authToken)
    WebSecurityFilter -> SessionManager: Create HTTP Session\n(JSESSIONID cookie)
    SessionManager --> WebSecurityFilter: Session created
    
    WebSecurityFilter -> Browser: Redirect to /admin/dashboard
    Browser -> Dashboard: GET /admin/dashboard\n(with JSESSIONID)
    Dashboard --> Browser: Render dashboard page
    Browser --> WebUser: Display dashboard
else Authentication Failure
    WebSecurityFilter -> Browser: Redirect to /login?error=true
    Browser -> LoginPage: Display error message
    LoginPage --> WebUser: "Invalid credentials"
end

note over WebSecurityFilter
  **Web Security Configuration:**
  - Session Management: STATEFUL
  - Authentication: Form-based
  - Session Cookie: JSESSIONID
  - Default Success URL: /admin/dashboard
end note

@enduml

